node_modules
*.log
.DS_Store

# SAM build artifacts and local deploy config, per service. samconfig.toml
# carries deploy parameters: stack name, region, alert email and the NAME of
# the SSM parameter holding a service's access token. Not the token itself,
# which CloudFormation resolves from SSM at deploy time and which never gets
# written here.
#
# These are matched at any depth rather than per-service, so a new service
# directory is covered the day it is created rather than the day someone
# remembers to add it here.
**/.aws-sam/
**/samconfig.toml
